  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Baem.jpg\" title=\"Baern - Sir Fess of Maerz\"><img alt=\"Baern - Sir Fess of Maerz\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"210\" src=\"/images/Baem.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Baem.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Baern - Sir Fess of Maerz</div></div></div>\n<p>Formerly stood out side the entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.\n</p><p>He said:\n\"Pray, please move along, there is nothing for thee to see here. Onward the dungeon, do keep moving. Many good thanks.\"\n</p><p>He has been replaced by <a href=\"/wiki/Agent_Illiot_Ness\" title=\"Agent Illiot Ness\">Agent Illiot Ness</a>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
